! LINE 27 IS CHECKED.  It was the one printed row this deck could not
! assemble, and it is now assembled FROM THE PAGE: opcodes.py gained
! M-1 on the strength of this very line, which spells the written-
! minus form on a VFL operation carrying a VFL dds.  The warning that
! stood here -- DO NOT CLOSE THE GAP BY WRITING M+1, it compiles
! ".22 B0" where the page prints ".32 B0" -- still holds and is why
! M-1 is a real entry and not an alias.  All thirty-four printed rows
! are checked.
!CHECK 005231.00 | 000010.64 80  014000.32 B0 | line 27 M-1(BU,12),$L+.52
